{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-03",
  "title": "鸣铳示警",
  "storyCode": "10-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7624e3e955b3550c4128fe1d14cf419dca28ca7f1b34fe5776b1909797773ce2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "啊！升降梯倒了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "再往下一点点，我、我的腿就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......拉住我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我是说拉住我的造物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "笨蛋......你别把我也拽倒了啊！带着你们，我本来就很难浮起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长、长官......谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "下回滚得更机灵些，少给我添乱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长官，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "这是......是炮弹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "不，要比一般的榴弹炮厉害得多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......而且，仅仅瞄准了这一小块区域？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "曼弗雷德......你是不是早就在看着了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "该死的心机深沉的魔族佬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "听好了，都给我停止行动！这些萨卡兹没有追的必要了，至于那个司机......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "这倒霉地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "中尉，这、这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "城防炮怎么会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......伦蒂尼姆的防御墙建成近七十年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "这是第一次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "墙上的防御炮，瞄准目标包含了......城内。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "威力不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "只用上了一成火力，就能轻松熔毁普通结构。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......这可是伦蒂尼姆的城防武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "还只是副炮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我们的武器专家说，如果我能启动主炮，这些炮能轻松击穿任意一艘高速战舰的装甲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "武器专家......是那位城防军工兵队的军官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "多亏你帮我抓到了他和他的妻女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......他还活着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "萨卡兹还用得上他，他就不会死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "炮手，瞄准十一号升降梯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "......偏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "可惜，准度还需要提升。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "毕竟这些炮口原本只能对外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "对外......在我们进入伦蒂尼姆之前，这些城防炮瞄准的是城外大公爵的军队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "当我们假借平息公爵争端的名义入城的时候，它们甚至都没有把我们的人纳入过瞄准范围——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "这也算对外吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "自从高卢战败、伊比利亚沉寂之后，维多利亚已很久不需要应对实质上的外敌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "嗯，所以殿下为我们谋到了这个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "如此精良的武器，本就该发挥更大作用，而不是架在这里，充当点缀门楣的装饰品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "炮手，启动活动目标动态追踪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "很好，成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "给它们调整朝向就耗费了我们整整一个月的时间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "所幸效果基本达标。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "控制住了这批武器，就意味着我们真正控制住了伦蒂尼姆的出入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "等我们把所有城防炮都调整好......就再没有人能躲在钢铁高墙的荫蔽之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "炮火似乎被深池引开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "这是......一次试验？他们的目的难道仅仅只是验证......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "不，他们真正的目标并不是这出入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "中尉，我们怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......继续往城内方向撤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "只是......萨迪恩区的其他地方也不再安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "萨卡兹对伦蒂尼姆的控制正在收紧。只要城防炮对准城内一天，我们的性命就随时都捏在他们手里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "除非......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "您在想什么，中尉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "没什么。走吧，先离开这里再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "这该死的城墙，该死的炮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长官，您的造物又被击碎了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我根本......来不及！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "别愣着了，滚，有多快滚多快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......逼着我们从这里逃跑是吧？曼弗雷德，你今天这么戏耍我，我早晚都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长官，我刚才看到有个熟悉的人影朝相反方向跑了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "那个人......褐色头发的鲁珀？是她？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "给我拦下——\n唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长官，小心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你犯什么蠢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "长官，我挡着，您快走，快走吧......您还要替领袖......找......找到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......好，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你是第十三个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "十三条塔拉人的命。我会替领袖记住，有朝一日，我要亲手、成倍地问萨卡兹讨回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "将军，深池的队伍完全被打散了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "看见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "但我们没注意到反抗军......这帮狡猾的虫豸！他们好像就露了一下头，城防炮启动以后，就又不见了踪影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "呃，他们会不会已经被打死了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "我......我就觉得我们的活不至于这么轻松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "明白就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "那他们是混进逃走的人群里了吗？要不要通知巡逻队，让他们拦住平民，继续搜捕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "继续炮轰出入口。对了，加大力度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "加大火力？出入口已经烂得差不多了，不太可能藏人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "他们不会再走这条路了。而且，你见过萨卡兹拔刀只拔一半的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "既然动了手，不如让他们看看清楚，我们能做到什么程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......你是故意在他们面前彰显力量。你想......断了他们的后路，逼他们自己走出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "这场捉迷藏耗时够久了。即便我还能等，殿下们与诸王庭也都已失去耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不论是谁，有所图谋的话，我只想麻烦他们快一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "博士，附近没有一处位置是绝对安全的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "就算我们全部撤到了这块结构下面，也还是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "......也还是随时都会被这个炮打穿啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "我粗略估计过了，别说我们头顶这块外墙底板，这炮要是火力全开的话，就连正式的移动城市地块也能击穿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "推进之王，你们伦蒂尼姆的炮真不是开玩笑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "......这也是我第一次见它们大规模启动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "那我们受到的欢迎还挺有规格咯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "规格再提升的话，我们会在距城墙五十公里处灰飞烟灭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "啊啊啊要撑不住了啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "阿米娅，我的无人机也加固不了这底板结构了，照这么轰下去，我们早晚一起被炸飞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们必须离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "深池士兵也在用最快的速度撤退......但他们用上了法术造物做掩体，还会丢下受伤的士兵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "text": "呜......啊......为什么我们这么倒霉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "text": "是不是我们都会死在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我们不能丢下这些伦蒂尼姆市民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "侦察小组，你们看到炮手了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没有吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "我们恐怕找不到炮手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "text": "伦蒂尼姆的城防炮，与我们面前的高墙，本来就是一体的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......也就是说，如果我们没法登上高墙或者进入高墙内部，就不可能停止这场轰炸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没人能顶着炮轰登墙。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们找不到进入城墙内部的途径。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "躲在这等死也不是办法！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "要不然，我出去引开这炮火？以我的本事，至少能坚持个几分钟......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "达格达",
          "text": "......她一个不行的话，我们一起去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "你们别添乱了好不好？达格达，你是不是跟因陀罗混久了，脑子里也都只剩下肌肉？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "达格达",
          "text": "呃......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "要是让人出去当诱饵是可行的，哪里轮得到你们俩在这里争？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "我们拿的防具，最多挨两下正规军的弩箭，这已经是工程部的朋友们努力了几个月的成果了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "你们这么急着去送死的话，就压根不该跟来伦蒂尼姆！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "好吧，我听你的，但我绝对不会让维娜在这里出事！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "我们甚至......连家门都还没进！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们出去确实没用。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "还没到说这些话的时候。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "博士，你是不是有想法了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "无人机。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "无人机......哦哦，我懂了......我说嘛，果然是这个逻辑。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "你在说什么啊可露希尔？博士话是少，但你不要说了跟没说一个样子啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "抱歉啊，我在想方案呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "这防御炮还挺智能的，射程范围这么大，它不可能完全依靠手动瞄准，所以它肯定会以某种方式锁定地面附近的活动目标。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "一两个人出去是没办法让炮火从我们头顶移开的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "可如果我的无人机全部出动，对瞄准算法来说，威胁性说不定能超过我们小队加上所有平民......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "text": "只是说不定吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "谁也没法保证啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "text": "可露希尔，加固失败，超出无人机承压阈值！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "text": "不出三十秒，这底板一定会塌......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们只能试试看了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "等博士指示，全员做好撤出准备。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "五、四、三——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "二——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "走！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "无人机发射！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "大家快跑！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......成功了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "只是这一小会，让我们转移到了没几步远的这地方......这块结构同样支撑不了多久。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "而且没有下一次机会了啊，我的宝贝无人机全被打烂了，就算是我，也没法原地给你们再变一批出来......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "往前往后都不算安全，想逃出轰炸区，我们还是要冒很大的险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "能有一条让我们绕开这里的路就好了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "听说你们在找路？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "欸欸？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "谁在这里？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "卡特斯小姐，我想和你们谈一谈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "但在此之前，你最好让你的手下把武器都从我身上移开。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你——你是什么人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "自我介绍得稍后再说了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "钢爪，砍刀，还有这位......呃，这位手上的锤子？女士，你的武器看起来非常帅，但能不能不要对着我的脑袋？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不然的话，你们的这位朋友可能会有生命危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "——博士！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？发生了什么？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他说的是我？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "谁都别靠近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "只要有人走近一步，这位朋友的后脑勺就会原地爆开。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "阿、阿米娅，是无人机......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "有一架无人机，趁我们大家不注意，偷偷绕了过去，这会就贴在博士后脑勺上啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "尖耳朵的女士，你很识货。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "实话说，我对你们真的越来越好奇了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "大家，放下武器。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯，这才对嘛。不过别忘记撤掉角落里那些弩。我敢打赌，自从我站到你们面前，你们的狙击手就没眨过眼睛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......照他说的做。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "——先生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "请你相信我，我们从来不会主动地给任何陌生人造成伤害。但是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "但凡你敢伤害你面前的人，请同样相信我，我可以不依赖任何武器，现在，立刻，让你永远失去威胁别人的能力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "咳咳......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "text": "唔呃......这地方已经够危险了，动手之前我们可能都会被炸死啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "没错，要是不想一起被萨卡兹炸成礼花的话，我们恐怕没时间站在这里互相指脑袋了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "各位，我有个建议，请你们放弃抵抗，跟我走一趟。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "在到地方之前，你们这位朋友还是借我一用——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不好吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我能拒绝吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "抱歉，你暂时没有选择的权利。请乖乖跟我走吧，看不见脸的朋友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
